        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6264509803921569,
        "y0": 0.4689545454545454,
        "x1": 0.6509607843137255,
        "y1": 0.469560606060606
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "caption",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5672549019607843,
        "y0": 0.4691540404040404,
        "x1": 0.8404052287581699,
        "y1": 0.49298484848484847
      },
      "text": "fA = 2/3(S1 · S2 + S3 · S4 + S1 · S3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6607843137254902,
        "y0": 0.4931414141414141,
        "x1": 0.8692156862745098,
        "y1": 0.5146515151515152
      },
      "text": "+ S2 · S4 + S1 · S4 + S2 · S3).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5180392156862745,
        "y0": 0.5229419191919192,
        "x1": 0.9184052287581699,
        "y1": 0.551780303030303
      },
      "text": "The functions f1E,2 for the E modes have been given before but are reproduced here,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5425506535947713,
        "y0": 0.5671830808080809,
        "x1": 0.8931503267973855,
        "y1": 0.6126818181818182
      },
      "text": "f2E = (1/2)(S2 · S4 + S1 · S3 − S1 · S4 − S2 · S3), f1E = 1/12(S1 · S4 + S2 · S3 + S2 · S4 + S1 · S3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6066470588235293,
        "y0": 0.5886515151515151,
        "x1": 0.6393921568627451,
        "y1": 0.5892575757575758
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "caption",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5180375816993464,
        "y0": 0.612989898989899,
        "x1": 0.8021552287581699,
        "y1": 0.6581439393939394
      },
      "text": "− 2S1 · S2 − 2S3 · S4). The functions fT",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6266666666666666,
        "y0": 0.6455656565656566,
        "x1": 0.8103643790849673,
        "y1": 0.6913257575757576
      },
      "text": "1,2,3 for the T2 modes are fT",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6390196078431373,
        "y0": 0.6464166666666666,
        "x1": 0.6445539215686275,
        "y1": 0.6506060606060606
      },
      "text": "2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6347042483660131,
        "y0": 0.6787474747474748,
        "x1": 0.8098022875816994,
        "y1": 0.7002575757575757
      },
      "text": "1 = (S2 · S3 − S1 · S4), fT",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6441176470588235,
        "y0": 0.7006590909090908,
        "x1": 0.6496519607843138,
        "y1": 0.7048484848484848
      },
      "text": "2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6441176470588235,
        "y0": 0.6797500000000001,
        "x1": 0.6496519607843138,
        "y1": 0.683939393939394
      },
      "text": "2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6266650326797386,
        "y0": 0.6998080808080809,
        "x1": 0.8098022875816994,
        "y1": 0.7332967171717171
      },
      "text": "2 = (S1 · S3 − S2 · S4), fT",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6347042483660131,
        "y0": 0.7207171717171716,
        "x1": 0.8053349673202614,
        "y1": 0.7422272727272727
      },
      "text": "3 = (S1 · S2 − S3 · S4)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6441160130718955,
        "y0": 0.721719696969697,
        "x1": 0.6496519607843138,
        "y1": 0.7259090909090908
      },
      "text": "2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5180375816993464,
        "y0": 0.7519292929292929,
        "x1": 0.9185571895424838,
        "y1": 0.7932967171717171
      },
      "text": "Now we can use TABLE I to convert the above couplings into pseudo-spin. It is easy to see that fA and fT",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5180375816993464,
        "y0": 0.7807171717171717,
        "x1": 0.9185784313725489,
        "y1": 0.9142045454545454
      },
      "text": "1,2,3 are all zero when converted to pseudo-spins, namely projected to the physical spin singlet sector. But f1E = (P14+P23+P24+P13−2P12−2P34)/(4√3) = −(√3/2)τx and f2E = (P24 + P13 − P14 − P23)/4 = (√3/2)τy. This has already been noted by Tchernyshyov et al.28, only the E modes can lift the degeneracy of the physical spin singlet ground states of the tetrahedron. Therefore the general spin lattice coupling is the form of (12) given in the main text.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5354885620915033,
        "y0": 0.781719696969697,
